  "sn14.14:0.1": "",
  "sn14.14:0.2": "",
  "sn14.14:0.3": "4. Hīnādhimuttikasuttaṃ ",
  "sn14.14:1.1": "Sāvatthiyaṃ viharati…pe… ",
  "sn14.14:1.2": "‘‘dhātusova , bhikkhave, sattā saṃsandanti samenti. ",
  "sn14.14:1.3": "Hīnādhimuttikā hīnādhimuttikehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti; ",
  "sn14.14:1.4": "kalyāṇādhimuttikā kalyāṇādhimuttikehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti’’. ",
  "sn14.14:2.1": "‘‘Atītampi kho , bhikkhave, addhānaṃ dhātusova sattā saṃsandiṃsu samiṃsu. ",
  "sn14.14:2.2": "Hīnādhimuttikā hīnādhimuttikehi saddhiṃ saṃsandiṃsu samiṃsu; ",
  "sn14.14:2.3": "kalyāṇādhimuttikā kalyāṇādhimuttikehi saddhiṃ saṃsandiṃsu samiṃsu. ",
  "sn14.14:3.1": "‘‘Anāgatampi kho , bhikkhave, addhānaṃ dhātusova sattā saṃsandissanti samessanti. ",
  "sn14.14:3.2": "Hīnādhimuttikā hīnādhimuttikehi saddhiṃ saṃsandissanti samessanti; ",
  "sn14.14:3.3": "kalyāṇādhimuttikā kalyāṇādhimuttikehi saddhiṃ saṃsandissanti samessanti. ",
  "sn14.14:4.1": "‘‘Etarahipi kho , bhikkhave, paccuppannaṃ addhānaṃ dhātusova sattā saṃsandanti samenti. ",
  "sn14.14:4.2": "Hīnādhimuttikā hīnādhimuttikehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti; ",
  "sn14.14:4.3": "kalyāṇādhimuttikā kalyāṇādhimuttikehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samentī’’ti. ",
  "sn14.14:4.4": "Catutthaṃ. "
}
